efault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-17T07:45:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T09:14:05Z","closed_at":"2025-08-17T17:12:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.beta5.official [c81fd6c51]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta5 - macOS Sequoia (15.1.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Max (Apple7) - Apple M1 Max (10 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nScripts ending with a function call with a lambda can't parse unless there's an empty line after:\n\n<img width=\"533\" height=\"184\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0dfbd193-3339-43dd-8e43-16a757118aef\" /><br>\n\nThe error is \"Expected end of file\" which doesn't seem right because `)` is followed by the end of file:\n\n<img width=\"353\" height=\"99\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f89bdc2-5246-4f91-9515-93396aac09be\" /><br>\n\nIf you add a newline, either on the same level or dedented, the error goes away:\n\n<img width=\"530\" height=\"199\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/806db074-c821-4b89-a16c-7a2c384a768c\" /><br>\n\nThis only happens with lambdas, for example this parses perfectly fine:\n\n<img width=\"465\" height=\"184\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1632a950-3dac-4b87-a8f4-82103284cf3f\" /><br>\n\nThis feels like a bug and can be a bit distracting having to deal with because sometimes my scripts end like that and I have to remember to add a new line\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee above\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[endoffile.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21821080/endoffile.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109688/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109688/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}